{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52371","headline":"回波乐 十四 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隐去来，寻空有，空有[毕]（必）竟两无名，二境安心欲何守？\n不长不短鉴空心，若（任录作「君」）见空心还是有。\n空有俱遣法无依，智者融心自安偶。\n隐去来，勿浪波波走。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}